      "id": "17907418cb05-q27",
      "number": 27,
      "question": "What is a probability that a leap year has 53 Sundays.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>What is a probability that a leap year has 53 Sundays.</p>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2/7",
          "html": "<p>2/7</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1/5",
          "html": "<p>1/5</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2/3",
          "html": "<p>2/3</p>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "3/4",
          "html": "<p>3/4</p>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Leap year has 366 days.</p><p>366/7 gives quotient as 52 and remainder as 2.<br/>Hence, there will be 52 Sundays for sure.<br/>2 days are extra after 52 Sundays/weeks.<br/>These 2 days can be: (Sunday, Monday), (Monday, Tuesday), (Tuesday, Wednesday), (Wednesday, Thursday), (Thursday, Friday), (Friday, Saturday), (Saturday, Sunday)<br/>Of these total 7 outcomes, the favorable outcomes are 2<br/>Probability = 2/7</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
